+# Resolve and ensure the working-tree directory SDD uses for ONE plan's
+# short-lived artifacts: task briefs, implementer reports, review packages,
+# and the progress ledger. Print the directory's absolute path.
+#
+# Each plan gets its own subdirectory, keyed by the plan file's basename with a
+# trailing .md stripped (the "slug"). Same plan file -> same slug -> same
+# directory, so ledger-based resume and post-compaction recovery keep working;
+# different plans -> different slugs, so their state never collides.
 #
 # The workspace lives in the working tree (not under .git/) because Claude Code
 # treats .git/ as a protected path and denies agent writes there — which blocks
